called Lenny Abrahamson.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.469
And yeah, it was a joy to be a part of.

00:03:27.469 --> 00:03:30.330
- What's the overall just cuz
even from that, it looks like

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.030
you might be doing something
you shouldn't be doing.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.996
Oh! Yep! (laughing) I was like -

00:03:34.996 --> 00:03:38.520
- I mean um, the gist of it is,

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:41.120
it basically - it's really
like like a coming of age story

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.833
for this girl who you saw briefly there

00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:47.310
called Frances who's this 21
year old student in Dublin

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:52.310
and she and her best friend
become kind of entangled

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.583
with an older couple and Frances and Nick,

00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:58.854
who I play, have an affair
and it all gets kind

00:03:58.854 --> 00:04:01.284
