conventional relationships

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.480
like friendships, families, marriages,

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:17.863
and uh -
- Interesting.

00:04:17.863 --> 00:04:19.537
Yeah. It's kind of, it's like a,

00:04:19.537 --> 00:04:21.112
a modern kind of love story.

00:04:21.112 --> 00:04:21.945
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:04:21.945 --> 00:04:23.290
- Kind of heavy but a really cool subject

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.756
that you don't really
see talked about a lot.

00:04:24.756 --> 00:04:25.589
- Yeah yeah.

00:04:25.589 --> 00:04:27.140
